otg.guide.welcome.title=§l§6欢迎与概览
otg.guide.welcome.body=§bWhat is OTG Backpack?§r\nOTG Backpack is a modular survival system that grows from a simple backpack into a full adventure field kit. It combines storage, upgrades, modules, tanks, workstations, cosmetics, placed-backpack access, and survival helpers.\n\n§6Current public-stable highlights§r\n• Strict tier progression from Basic to Netherite\n• Backpack Mode and Placement Mode\n• Quick Open from the carry slot\n• Personal carry-slot and Offhand Display settings\n• Passive priority/mainhand helpers are readonly mirrors unless the backpack is actually open\n• Safer Netherite Overpack Page 1 / Page 2 storage\n• Stockpile virtual bulk storage for Netherite\n• Mobility/combat modules: Dive, Speed, Jump Boost, Strength, Excavation, Forestry\n• Netherite utility buttons: Enchantment Table, Brewing Stand, Smithing Table, Ender Chest, plus the older stations\n• Teleport guard for Waystones and other addon teleports\n• Cosmetics: Creeper, Enderman, Snowfox, Ghast, Ender Dragon\n\n§7This guide follows the stable public build, not experimental Potion Case/QIDB test builds.§r
otg.guide.quickstart.title=§l§e快速开始
otg.guide.quickstart.body=§bStarter Recipe§r\nTop row: Leather, Iron Nugget, Leather\nMiddle row: Iron Ingot, Chest, Iron Ingot\nBottom row: Leather, Iron Ingot, Leather\n\n§bGuidebook Recipe§r\n2x2 layout:\nTop row: Leather, Paper\nBottom row: Leather, Paper\n\nUses 2 Leather and 2 Paper.\n\n§bCarry Priority§r\nPassive systems check this order:\n1. Hotbar Slot 9\n2. Your personal carry slot, default Inventory Slot 27\n3. Offhand\n4. Mainhand\n\nOpen the Guidebook, then choose Backpack Settings (Personal) to change your carry slot or turn Offhand Backpack Display on/off.\n\n§bOpening§r\nOpen the backpack normally when held or accessible. If it is in the carry slot, use Quick Open: Double Sneak, then Jump.\n\n§bModes§r\nBackpack Mode is for normal carried use. Placement Mode lets you place the backpack in-world.\n\n§bImportant storage note§r\nPotions and Tipped Arrows are blocked from normal backpack storage in the public build for multiplayer stability. Legacy QIDB-backed Potions and Tipped Arrows are not loaded by this public build. Recover them with an older rescue-capable build before updating if needed.
otg.guide.tiers.title=§l§6阶级进阶
otg.guide.tiers.body=§b严格阶级升级§r\n必须一级一级升级，不能从基础直接跳到钻石或下界合金。\n\n§e顺序§r\n基础 → 铜 → 铁 → 金 → 钻石 → 下界合金\n\n§b升级方法§r\n打开背包，放入准确的下一阶升级物品。太高阶的升级物品会被拒绝，并提示所需背包阶级。\n\n§b概览§r\n铜增加空间和初始储罐。铁解锁熔炉。金/钻石扩展工具与模块。下界合金为最高阶并支持 Overpack。
otg.guide.modules.title=§l§d模块与能力
otg.guide.modules.body=§bHow Modules Work§r\nModules go into unlocked side module slots. If a slot is not visible, the backpack tier is probably too low. Invalid module placements are rejected or safely ejected.\n\n§eSurvival / protection modules§r\n• Radiance: spawns a light buddy for caves. Portal/teleport safety can temporarily suppress it.\n• Sustenance: auto-feeds from the dedicated food slot when hunger needs it.\n• Totem+: at 3 hearts or lower, it tries to equip a totem from backpack storage into Offhand.\n• Soulbind: protects backpack recovery for 3 death uses.\n• Hearts / Vitality: increases survivability.\n\n§eMobility / combat modules§r\n• Dive: underwater support while submerged, including the 120s oxygen helper behavior.\n• Speed: grants Speed I through Diamond, and Speed II on Netherite.\n• Jump Boost: grants Jump Boost I through Diamond, and Jump Boost II on Netherite.\n• Strength: grants Strength I through Diamond, and Strength II on Netherite.\n• Excavation / Haste: grants Haste I through Diamond, and Haste II on Netherite. It has durability and should be repaired with XP when worn out.\n• Forestry: helps harvest natural trees. Use carefully around builds and farms.\n\n§eStorage / automation modules§r\n• Magnet: pulls nearby dropped items toward the active backpack.\n• Void: deletes matching filtered items. Use carefully.\n• Compressor: compacts supported materials while sorting.\n• Furnace / Blast: improves portable smelting support.\n• Overpack: Netherite-only extra storage page. Use the page button to swap Page 1 / Page 2.\n• Stockpile: Netherite-only virtual bulk storage for selected simple stackable items. Use filters, Deposit/Collect behavior, and row Withdraw buttons.\n\n§bReadonly helper safety§r\nBackpacks in Slot 9, your personal carry slot, Offhand, or Mainhand can run passive module checks. These passive helpers are readonly mirrors unless the backpack UI is actually open, preventing carried backpacks from overwriting storage during logout/login.
otg.guide.workstations.title=§l§b工作站与储罐
otg.guide.workstations.body=§bPortable Stations§r\nHigher tiers unlock helper stations such as Crafting Table, Virtual Furnace, Stonecutter, and Anvil. Disabled stations hide and the remaining station buttons shift, so the row stays clean.\n\n§6Built-in Crafting Table§r\nWhen the built-in crafting panel is enabled, the Crafting Table button opens a 3x3 crafting panel inside the backpack. The panel includes Craft All and Spawn Table. Successful workstation deployments close the backpack automatically.\n\n§6Max Enchanting Setup§r\nThe Netherite enchanting button deploys the supplied 5x6 temporary structure: a real Enchantment Table with a complete bookshelf arrangement for maximum enchanting power. Players do not need to carry or supply Bookshelves. The setup rotates so its entrance faces the deploying player. It automatically clears harmless natural ground cover such as short grass, flowers, ferns, bushes, leaf litter, and snow layers, but still needs a flat supported 5x6 (or rotated 6x5) area with 4 blocks of headroom.\n\n§eAnti-farming protection§r\nEvery generated block belongs to one tracked OTG workstation. Breaking any part removes the complete setup directly with no drops. Protected blocks are excluded from explosion damage, piston interference triggers cleanup, and the entire setup disappears when its owner moves more than 32 blocks away or deploys another workstation.\n\n§6Spawn limit§r\nOnly one backpack-spawned workstation is kept per player. Spawning a new portable station removes the previous one.\n\n§6Virtual Furnace§r\nThe built-in furnace is lava-powered. It checks stored lava first, then lava buckets inside backpack storage. When a lava bucket is used, it returns an empty bucket.\n\n§bFluid Tanks§r\nCopper and higher tiers can store fluids. Capacity grows by tier: Copper 20, Iron 40, Gold 60, Diamond 80, Netherite 100.\n\n§6Rest Campfire§r\nDeploy it from the backpack to rest to Morning, Midday, Night, or Midnight. In multiplayer, time changes use a sleep-percentage style vote.
otg.guide.cosmetics.title=§l§5外观与风格
otg.guide.cosmetics.body=§bCosmetic Slot§r\nCosmetics change the backpack appearance without replacing backpack data. Your backpack ID, tier, modules, storage, tanks, and progress stay intact.\n\n§eHow to use§r\n1. Open the backpack.\n2. Place a valid cosmetic item in the cosmetic slot.\n3. The backpack switches visual style.\n4. Remove it to return to the normal look.\n\n§6Current cosmetic examples§r\n• Creeper\n• Enderman\n• Snowfox\n• Ghast\n• Ender Dragon\n\n§bCosmetic outline§r\nThe cosmetic slot has its own outline so players can tell it apart from normal storage and module slots. Invalid items are ejected safely.
otg.guide.tips.title=§l§3提示与排错
otg.guide.tips.body=§bRecommended UI§r\nClassic UI with GUI Scale Modifier -2 is recommended for the biggest layouts. Pocket UI is supported, but large grids can need scrolling depending on device and UI scale.\n\n§bPersonal settings§r\nUse Guidebook > Backpack Settings (Personal) to change your carry slot and toggle Offhand Backpack Display. Turning Offhand Display off only removes the fake visual backpack item; it does not disable Quick Open, modules, or the real Offhand slot.\n\n§bStockpile safety§r\nStockpile is virtual bulk storage, not a normal backpack page. Its recipe now combines Netherite Ingots, Ender Chest, Compressor, Template, Magnet, and Void. Withdraw stored items before removing the Stockpile module. The module can lock itself while stored counts exist so players do not accidentally orphan stored items.\n\n§bOverpack safety§r\nOverpack is Netherite-only. Page 1 and Page 2 are saved separately. If testing old builds already mixed your items, separate them once, close the backpack, then retest on this build.\n\n§bTeleport safety§r\nIf a Waystone or another addon teleports you while a backpack session is active, OTG tries to save the active open backpack, close the helper, remove stale helpers, and rebuild safely after the teleport.\n\n§bSpecial item stability§r\nPublic builds block Potions and Tipped Arrows from normal backpack storage. This avoids the older QIDB/special item page problems. With GENERATE_QIDB set to False, the public pack omits the QIDB runtime, storage entities, structure operations, and ticking-area creation.\n\n§bIf something is locked or missing§r\nCheck tier, module, mode, BP/RP version, world settings, and UI scale.
otg.guide.faq.title=§l§9OTG 常见问题
otg.guide.faq.choose=请选择一个问题：
otg.guide.faq.video.q=推荐的视频设置是什么？
otg.guide.faq.video.a=推荐使用 Classic UI，GUI Scale Modifier -2。Pocket UI 也支持，但大背包可能需要滚动。
otg.guide.faq.recipe.q=如何合成初始背包？
otg.guide.faq.recipe.a=Basic Backpack recipe: Leather, Iron Nugget, Leather / Iron Ingot, Chest, Iron Ingot / Leather, Iron Ingot, Leather. Guidebook recipe: Leather, Paper / Leather, Paper (2 Leather + 2 Paper). OTG recipes appear in the normal crafting table and supported recipes also work in the built-in Crafting Table panel.
otg.guide.faq.upgrade.q=如何升级背包？
otg.guide.faq.upgrade.a=放入准确的下一阶升级物品。顺序：基础、铜、铁、金、钻石、下界合金。
otg.guide.faq.void.q=虚空过滤如何运作？
otg.guide.faq.void.a=虚空模块会永久删除过滤匹配物品。
otg.guide.faq.jukebox.q=如何使用点唱机槽位？
otg.guide.faq.jukebox.a=放入有效唱片。无效物品会被弹出。
otg.guide.faq.locked.q=为什么槽位被锁定？
otg.guide.faq.locked.a=Locked or missing slots usually mean the tier is too low, the needed module is missing, the backpack is in the wrong mode, a world setting disabled the feature, Stockpile still has stored items, the UI layout/scale is hiding it, or BP/RP versions do not match.
